        <h3>Ways to give</h3>
        <p><strong>One-time gift</strong> — UPI, bank transfer or card.</p>
        <p><strong>Monthly giving</strong> — a small recurring amount goes a long way; it's the steadiest support we can receive.</p>
        <p><strong>Sponsor a participant</strong> — fund a single scholarship place on a program.</p>
        <p><strong>In-kind</strong> — venues, printing, design, translation and volunteer hours.</p>
